  "prefLabel": "Pos 1501.02 Description of Program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pos 1501.02 Description of Program.\n\n(a) The program shall provide tuition repayments to CART providers and sign language interpreters in order to promote their initial hiring and retention in New Hampshire.\n\n(b) Tuition repayment shall only be awarded to those individuals who have completed CART or sign language interpreter training.\n\nSource. #9677, eff 3-13-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pos100-1700.html"
